1 REM FBCS FIL-0188
2 REM CLAIM A-11.3.2-12
3 REM TYPE SELF
100 PRINT "FIL-0188 TEMPLATE STATEMENT ACCEPTS NUMERIC*E AND WITH <LINE> USES IT (11.3.2 N22 l.7445)"
110 OPEN #1: NAME "FIL0188.DAT", ACCESS OUTIN, ORGANIZATION SEQUENTIAL, RECTYPE NATIVE
120 TEMPLATE: NUMERIC*E
130 WRITE #1, WITH 120: 123456789.123456789
140 SET #1: POINTER BEGIN
150 READ #1, WITH 120: X
160 CLOSE #1
170 IF X = 123456789.123456789 THEN PRINT "*** TEST PASSED ***" ELSE PRINT "*** TEST FAILED: VALUE"; X
180 END
